  "answer": "The March\u202f12 release/deploy of the **auth\u2011gateway** triggered the PaymentService disruptions \u2013 it caused timeouts in checkout and a spike in latency across the payments region\u3010S1\u3011\u3010S2\u3011. The resulting payment\u2011processing outage lasted about six hours\u3010S3\u3011. These details are documented in the change log (live_b) and the incident report (live_a).",
